 CH                                                                                             1/2
   General                                        Diff
    ?               Show every key                 n               Next hunk
    : C-p           Command palette                N p             Previous hunk
    r               Reload from git                Enter o         Unfold, or toggle annotation
    q C-c           Quit                           j ↓             Down a line
    Esc             Back, or quit                  k ↑             Up a line
                                                   C-d             Down half a page
    Files                                          C-u             Up half a page
    ] Tab           Next file                      PgDn C-f Space  Down a page
    [ S-Tab         Previous file                  PgUp            Up a page
    /               Find file                      g Home          Top of the file
    C-b f           Toggle file list               G End           Bottom of the file
    e               Open in $EDITOR                H S-←           Cursor to the old side
    y               Copy path                      L S-→           Cursor to the new side
    Y               Copy path:line or lines        h ←             Scroll left
    V               Select lines                   l →             Scroll right
    v               Mark viewed, go to next
    u               Next unviewed file             View
                                                   s               Split or unified
                                                   w               Wrap long lines
                                                   z               Fold unchanged lines
                                                   W               Ignore whitespace
